# Record the README demo with https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs
#   vhs demo.tape
Output docs/demo.gif
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 640
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 80ms

Type "devsweep ~/projects"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Down 2
Space
Space
Space
Sleep 1s
Type "s"
Sleep 1s
Type "d"
Sleep 1500ms
Type "y"
Sleep 3s
